<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale gets Starsem satellite deal.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale gets Starsem satellite deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Aerospatiale said on Friday a Franco-Russian launching consortium had awarded it a contract to develop a payload dispenser for the orbital positioning of Globalstar satellites.</p>
<p>The &quot;intelligent&quot; payload structure carries four Globalstar satellites and ensures their transfer from injection orbit to final orbit, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
